 "notes": "All six planned kinds kept. Old flat models folded into archetype versions (SX-70, SLR 680, Pronto, Sun 600/One600, instax mini/WIDE, TL70, Model 100, Automatic 350, LiPlay, mini Evo, Fling/Ultra/FunSaver/QuickSnap, Ondu 135). Old ranges replaced by archetypes. Peel-apart definition widened to include roll-film Land Cameras (Model 95). Left out: Holga k16 merge handled by the other shelf owner (Holga archetype added here); Zero Image 69/612/4x5, other Ondu models, LomoGraflok and Diana instant backs as cameras, Leica Sofort 2 and Polaroid Flip/I-1 (not confirmed on retrieved pages or ambiguous type); years omitted where pages gave none. MiNT/Zero Image/Ondu countries left blank (not on retrieved pages). Parallel fetch unavailable (no credit); used WebFetch and Firecrawl."
}